---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Supply recycled materials with Bukjum" description="Contact Bukjum to discuss recycled plastic supply, processing, quantities and location.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">FOR MATERIAL SUPPLIERS</p>
      <h1>Bring your supply.<br /><em>Build a connection.</em></h1>
      <p>Bukjum is building a marketplace that connects recycled material suppliers with industrial buyers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container supplier-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p>
        <h2>Reliable details<br /><em>help business move.</em></h2>
        <p class="body-copy">Tell us what material you have, how it is processed, the quantities you can supply and where it is located. Accurate details help us match supply with buyer requirements.</p>
        <div class="supplier-facts">
          <div><strong>01</strong><span>Share your materials and processing steps</span></div>
          <div><strong>02</strong><span>Tell us your volume, packaging and location</span></div>
          <div><strong>03</strong><span>We follow up to understand buyer fit</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-card supplier-contact-card">
        <h2>Contact the Bukjum team</h2>
        <p>Use the same contact details shown at the Bukjum Recycling Centre. Tell us what materials you supply, how they are processed, your monthly volume, packaging, and location.</p>
        <dl class="supplier-contact-details">
          <div><dt>WhatsApp</dt><dd><a href="https://wa.me/2348064791798?text=Hello%20Bukjum%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20supplying%20recycled%20materials." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+2348064791798</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+2348064791798">+2348064791798</a><br /><a href="tel:+2348161105054">+2348161105054</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:isaq1960@gmail.com">isaq1960@gmail.com</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Head office</dt><dd>No 1, Oke Awon Street, Ede Road, Egbedi, Osun State - Nigeria</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://wa.me/2348064791798?text=Hello%20Bukjum%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20supplying%20recycled%20materials." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>